# App folders that other repos deploy onto ci01 (rsync from asyla/projects/<app>/scripts/deploy-host.sh).
# update_scripts.sh deletes anything under ~/scripts/ci01/ that this repo does not track unless a
# .gitignore matches it, so every such folder must be listed here or the next update removes it.
# Never add these folders to this repo: two masters writing one path is how d04 drifted.
# None yet: ci01 is CI only, with no internal-access or external-access deploy (ci01/host.toml).
# Secrets (*.env) and runtime files (__pycache__/) are kept by the repo's root .gitignore.
